1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,980
This bunker has room

2
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,460
for 100,000 people.

3
00:00:03,480 --> 00:00:04,880
And every single one

4
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:06,600
is empty. …almost.

5
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:07,720
The blast door won't seal

6
00:00:07,740 --> 00:00:08,990
until it's full.

7
00:00:09,010 --> 00:00:10,870
So who sleeps down here?

8
00:00:10,890 --> 00:00:11,560
You.

9
00:00:11,580 --> 00:00:12,400
Everyone who follows

10
00:00:12,420 --> 00:00:13,040
gets a bed,

11
00:00:13,060 --> 00:00:15,190
with their name on the door.

12
00:00:15,210 --> 00:00:16,290
At 1,000,

13
00:00:16,310 --> 00:00:17,420
the lights come on.

14
00:00:17,440 --> 00:00:18,500
At 10,000,

15
00:00:18,520 --> 00:00:19,880
the air starts flowing.

16
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:21,420
And at 100,000,

17
00:00:21,440 --> 00:00:22,120
the door seals,

18
00:00:22,140 --> 00:00:23,460
and we wait out

19
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:25,340
the end of the world.

20
00:00:25,590 --> 00:00:26,370
But there's something

21
00:00:26,390 --> 00:00:27,800
I haven't told you.

22
00:00:27,820 --> 00:00:28,580
We thought this bunker

23
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:30,240
had seven levels.

24
00:00:30,260 --> 00:00:31,100
Then we found

25
00:00:31,120 --> 00:00:32,170
an eighth.

26
00:00:32,190 --> 00:00:33,190
There was only one bed

27
00:00:33,210 --> 00:00:34,150
down there.

28
00:00:34,170 --> 00:00:35,460
Bed 000.

29
00:00:35,480 --> 00:00:36,320
Its door was locked

30
00:00:36,340 --> 00:00:37,840
from the inside.

31
00:00:38,360 --> 00:00:39,400
So we welded

32
00:00:39,420 --> 00:00:40,960
the hatch shut.

33
00:00:41,310 --> 00:00:41,750
Pick your spot

34
00:00:41,770 --> 00:00:43,010
in the comments.

35
00:00:43,030 --> 00:00:44,350
By the garden,

36
00:00:44,480 --> 00:00:45,910
next to the armory,

37
00:00:45,930 --> 00:00:47,170
or on B7,

38
00:00:47,190 --> 00:00:49,040
right above bed 000.

39
00:00:49,060 --> 00:00:49,500
Follow me,

40
00:00:49,520 --> 00:00:50,320
and get inside

41
00:00:50,340 --> 00:00:52,260
before the door closes.
